flowchart TD

    U[User Task] --> SF[AWS Step Functions]

    SF --> P[Planner]
    P --> B[Amazon Bedrock]

    B --> E[ECS Fargate]
    E --> S[Docker Sandbox]

    S --> W[EFS Workspace]
    S --> O[Observe Execution]

    O --> R{Execution Successful?}

    R -->|Yes| D[Task Complete]
    R -->|No| A[Bedrock Error Analysis]

    A --> F{Safe Fix Available?}

    F -->|Yes| E
    F -->|No| RB[Git Rollback]

    SF --> DB[DynamoDB Task State]
    E --> S3[S3 Checkpoints / Artifacts]

    SF --> CW[CloudWatch Logs & Metrics]
    SF --> XR[X-Ray Tracing]

    IAM[IAM Least Privilege] -.-> SF
    IAM -.-> E
    IAM -.-> DB
    IAM -.-> S3

    G[Safety Manager] -.-> SF
    G -.-> E
    G -.-> RB
